The unknown spectrum T113.csv was compared with the reference spectra in reference_library.csv. To ensure a valid comparison, the unknown spectrum was interpolated onto the reference Raman shift axis. Both the unknown and each reference spectrum were then L2-normalized, and their cosine similarity (the dot product of the normalized vectors) was calculated.

The results indicate a very high similarity to polystyrene spectra, with PS_01 being the closest match.

